    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在亮度驱动扫描线位移之前进行的平滑程度，控制起伏由尖锐到圆润。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在亮度驅動掃描線位移之前進行的平滑程度，控制起伏由尖銳到圓潤。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jusqu'où la luminosité est lissée avant qu'elle ne déplace les lignes, des crêtes pointues aux collines arrondies"
