    "Linear runs along the line; Radial spreads out from the start point": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线性渐变沿直线过渡，径向渐变从起点向外扩散"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "線性漸變沿直線過渡，徑向漸變從起點向外擴散"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Courons linéaires le long de la ligne; Radial s'étend du point de départ"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Linear verläuft entlang der Linie; Radial breitet sich vom Startpunkt aus"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corres lineales a lo largo de la línea; Radial se extiende desde el punto de inicio"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "線に沿ってリニアラン; 放射状は、開始点から広がります"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "라인은 라인을 따라 달리고, 라인은 출발점에서 흩어져 있다"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linear splits along one direction; Radial splits outwards from a center, sharp there": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「线性」沿一个方向分离通道，「径向」从清晰的中心向外分离通道。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「線性」沿一個方向分離通道，「徑向」從清晰的中心向外分離通道。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scissions linéaires dans une direction; Séparations radiales vers l'extérieur d'un centre, pointu là"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Linear teilt sich entlang einer Richtung; Radial spaltet sich von einem Zentrum nach außen, dort scharf"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
